dsh-workbench
==============

A single-package right-side panel plugin for the DSH Web GUI: a VS Code-style
single panel with Files/Git tabs plus a Preview column (file explorer,
Source-Control-like changes + commit, branch switching, and an inline Git graph).

Derived from the dsh-web-ui monorepo (https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui):

  * dsh-aionui-panel  — file explorer / preview / SCM changes panel
  * dsh-git-graph     — branch switching + Git graph

Thank you to zhu1090093659 and the dsh-web-ui contributors for the upstream work,
and to the AionUi project (iOfficeAI/AionUi) for the original right-panel design
that dsh-aionui-panel re-implemented.

This fork intentionally diverges from upstream (one-time fork, no upstream rebase):
it merges the two plugins' host git services into one, moves the branch selector
off the input header into the Git column, inlines the Git graph, and adds commit
plus push/pull.
